Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.71,0:00:04.58,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,众所周知 Windows XP可以通过电话激活
Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.71,0:00:04.58,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,As we all know, Windows XP can be activated via a telephone call,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:05.00,0:00:08.68,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,这似乎也是最后一个提供电话激活选项的版本
Dialogue: 2,0:00:05.00,0:00:08.68,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,and seemingly this was the last version providing a phone activation option,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:08.94,0:00:12.22,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,因为当时互联网还不像现在这样普及
Dialogue: 2,0:00:08.94,0:00:12.22,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,because the Internet wasn't as commonplace back then as it is now.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:13.06,0:00:15.12,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,如今 Windows 系统会连接网络
Dialogue: 2,0:00:13.06,0:00:15.12,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Nowadays, Windows connects to the Internet,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:15.38,0:00:16.76,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,上传个人数据
Dialogue: 2,0:00:15.38,0:00:16.76,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,deposits your personal data,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:17.12,0:00:18.40,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,并自动完成激活
Dialogue: 2,0:00:17.12,0:00:18.40,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,and activates automatically.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:19.28,0:00:25.20,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,但鲜为人知的是 其实现在仍可通过电话激活Windows系统
Dialogue: 2,0:00:19.28,0:00:25.20,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,However, only select few know it's actually still possible to activate Windows via a telephone call.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:25.76,0:00:28.08,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,实际上 微软从未取消该功能
Dialogue: 2,0:00:25.76,0:00:28.08,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,In fact, this option was never removed,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:28.42,0:00:30.28,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,甚至在特定场景下依然实用
Dialogue: 2,0:00:28.42,0:00:30.28,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,and it even has practical use cases.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:31.20,0:00:34.64,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,本期视频我将演示通过电话激活Windows 11
Dialogue: 2,0:00:31.20,0:00:34.64,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,In this video, I'll activate Windows 11 via a phone call.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.53,0:00:42.71,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10\fad(200,0)}翻译/压制/字幕制作：HAF半个水果
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.36,0:00:53.36,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10\fad(200,200)\pos(1943.704,1802.074)}使用AI工具翻译，如有不准确的地方请在弹幕或评论区指正，谢谢！\N！！真的有人看不到这行字！！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.63,0:01:03.63,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10\fad(200,200)\pos(1926.149,1835.186)}翻译质量权威评价：原来25年就有小拉即用机翻糊弄人了
Dialogue: 1,0:00:42.91,0:00:49.43,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\fs170}Windows 11的激活机制其实与Windows Vista的激活机制差异不大
Dialogue: 2,0:00:42.91,0:00:49.43,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,The Windows 11 activation mechanism actually isn't this much different to the activation mechanism found in Windows Vista,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:49.66,0:00:52.50,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,而Vista的机制又沿袭自Windows XP
Dialogue: 2,0:00:49.66,0:00:52.50,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,and Windows Vista's mechanism has Windows XP heritage.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:53.88,0:00:56.40,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,例如 Windows XP曾有两种密钥类型
Dialogue: 2,0:00:53.88,0:00:56.40,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,For example, Windows XP had two types of keys,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:56.92,0:00:58.58,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,零售版和OEM版
Dialogue: 2,0:00:56.92,0:00:58.58,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Retail and OEM.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:59.24,0:01:03.86,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,自Windows Vista起 所有产品密钥统一为单一类型
Dialogue: 2,0:00:59.24,0:01:03.86,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Since Windows Vista, all product keys have been unified into one single type,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:04.58,0:01:06.18,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,用Windows XP的概念来说
Dialogue: 2,0:01:04.58,0:01:06.18,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,and speaking in Windows XP terms,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:06.30,0:01:08.52,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,这些密钥融合了零售版与OEM版的特性
Dialogue: 2,0:01:06.30,0:01:08.52,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,they were a mix of Retail and OEM,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:08.80,0:01:10.12,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,但更偏向零售版属性
Dialogue: 2,0:01:08.80,0:01:10.12,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,but mostly Retail.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:10.84,0:01:13.92,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,不过微软引入了附加功能和渠道体系
Dialogue: 2,0:01:10.84,0:01:13.92,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,However, they introduced additions and channels.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:14.58,0:01:16.48,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,附加功能指的是特定SKU（库存单位）
Dialogue: 2,0:01:14.58,0:01:16.48,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,The addition is an SKU,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:17.02,0:01:18.96,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,例如家庭版 入门版
Dialogue: 2,0:01:17.02,0:01:18.96,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,for example Home, Starter,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:19.16,0:01:20.42,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,旗舰版等等
Dialogue: 2,0:01:19.16,0:01:20.42,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Ultimate, and so forth,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:20.84,0:01:22.44,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,而渠道则对应密钥类型
Dialogue: 2,0:01:20.84,0:01:22.44,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,and the channel is a key type.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:22.98,0:01:25.38,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,实际上我们又回到了起点
Dialogue: 2,0:01:22.98,0:01:25.38,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,So in practice, we came back to where we started,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:25.98,0:01:27.18,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,只是微软增加了附加功能
Dialogue: 2,0:01:25.98,0:01:27.18,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,except they added additions,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:27.18,0:01:30.50,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,并且加密算法经历了两次升级
Dialogue: 2,0:01:27.18,0:01:30.50,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,and the cryptographic algorithm was improved twice,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:30.78,0:01:36.46,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,从Bing 2002发展到P-Key 2005再到P-Key 2009组合
Dialogue: 2,0:01:30.78,0:01:36.46,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,from Bing 2002 to the P-Key 2005 and the P-Key 2009 combo.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:37.02,0:01:39.08,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,他们引入了软件许可服务
Dialogue: 2,0:01:37.02,0:01:39.08,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,They added a Software Licensing Service,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:39.36,0:01:43.82,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,简称SLS 后在Windows 7中更名为软件保护服务
Dialogue: 2,0:01:39.36,0:01:43.82,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,aka SLS, which was then renamed to Software Protection Service,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:43.98,0:01:45.96,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,简称SPP
Dialogue: 2,0:01:43.98,0:01:45.96,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,aka SPP, in Windows 7,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:46.52,0:01:48.58,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,该服务一直沿用至今
Dialogue: 2,0:01:46.52,0:01:48.58,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,and it remained to this very day.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:49.64,0:01:51.12,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,期间还有其他细微调整
Dialogue: 2,0:01:49.64,0:01:51.12,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,There were other little changes,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:51.30,0:01:54.32,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,但核心机制自Vista时代起始终保持不变
Dialogue: 2,0:01:51.30,0:01:54.32,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,but the idea remained the same since the Windows Vista days.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:55.28,0:01:59.92,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,新版系统唯一新增的是客户端授权服务
Dialogue: 2,0:01:55.28,0:01:59.92,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,The only extra addition in newer versions is the Client License Service,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:00.48,0:02:05.02,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,简称ClipSVC 负责处理微软商店的DRM保护
Dialogue: 2,0:02:00.48,0:02:05.02,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,aka ClipSVC, which handles the Microsoft Store DRM.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:06.22,0:02:08.76,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,由于可通过微软商店购买Windows系统
Dialogue: 2,0:02:06.22,0:02:08.76,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,And since you can purchase Windows in Microsoft Store,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.33,0:02:15.31,Enderman-CN-C,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\pos(1890.666,750.666)}在微软商店中无法找到它\N但每个SKU都有自己独立的包族名称（每个SKU都是独立的应用）
Dialogue: 1,0:02:09.22,0:02:10.60,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,该系统在商店中被视为应用程序
Dialogue: 2,0:02:09.22,0:02:10.60,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,it's considered to be an app there,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:11.30,0:02:15.04,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,该服务会替代经典SPP进行在线激活
Dialogue: 2,0:02:11.30,0:02:15.04,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,that service overrides the classic SPP for online activation.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:16.10,0:02:20.04,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,而SPP则处理所有离线激活方式 例如KMS激活
Dialogue: 2,0:02:16.10,0:02:20.04,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,SPP handles all the offline methods like KMS activation,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:20.58,0:02:23.00,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,预激活或电话激活
Dialogue: 2,0:02:20.58,0:02:23.00,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,pre-activation, or telephone activation.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:23.62,0:02:26.18,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,Windows激活机制确实混乱不堪
Dialogue: 2,0:02:23.62,0:02:26.18,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Windows activation really is a complete mess.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:27.02,0:02:28.74,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,但这些分类究竟有何意义？
Dialogue: 2,0:02:27.02,0:02:28.74,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,What does it all even matter though?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:29.70,0:02:31.22,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,并非所有密钥类型
Dialogue: 2,0:02:29.70,0:02:31.22,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Not all types of keys,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:31.68,0:02:33.56,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,现称为渠道
Dialogue: 2,0:02:31.68,0:02:33.56,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,which are called channels now,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:33.88,0:02:35.72,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,都支持电话激活
Dialogue: 2,0:02:33.88,0:02:35.72,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,can be activated via a phone call,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:35.98,0:02:38.42,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,也并非所有客户端都支持电话激活
Dialogue: 2,0:02:35.98,0:02:38.42,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,and not all clients support phone activation.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:39.20,0:02:41.46,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,Windows系统仅存在几种产品密钥类型
Dialogue: 2,0:02:39.20,0:02:41.46,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,There are only a couple types of product keys in Windows.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:42.34,0:02:45.70,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,零售版：指从零售商处
Dialogue: 2,0:02:42.34,0:02:45.70,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Retail, meaning the product key was purchased from a retailer,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:46.06,0:02:47.22,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,或微软商店购买的密钥
Dialogue: 2,0:02:46.06,0:02:47.22,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,or Microsoft Store.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:47.98,0:02:49.30,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,多次激活密钥
Dialogue: 2,0:02:47.98,0:02:49.30,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Multiple activation key,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:49.70,0:02:54.24,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,即企业为多台设备统一配置的零售密钥
Dialogue: 2,0:02:49.70,0:02:54.24,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,basically a retail key arranged for multiple devices at once by a business.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:54.98,0:02:58.34,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,批量授权密钥：由微软提供
Dialogue: 2,0:02:54.98,0:02:58.34,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Generic volume key, meaning the key is supplied by Microsoft,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:58.84,0:03:02.06,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,公开可用且受软件保护平台广泛支持
Dialogue: 2,0:02:58.84,0:03:02.06,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,is publicly available and widely supported by SPP.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:02.90,0:03:04.52,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,客户特定批量密钥
Dialogue: 2,0:03:02.90,0:03:04.52,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Customer specific volume key,
Dialogue: 1,0:03:04.66,0:03:06.80,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,即KMS服务器的产品密钥
Dialogue: 2,0:03:04.66,0:03:06.80,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,which is the product key of the KMS server.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:07.48,0:03:09.16,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,OEM授权证书
Dialogue: 2,0:03:07.48,0:03:09.16,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,OEM certificate of authority,
Dialogue: 1,0:03:09.86,0:03:14.96,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,试想笔记本电脑底部贴着的Windows许可标签要求输入密钥
Dialogue: 2,0:03:09.86,0:03:14.96,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,now imagine a laptop with a Windows license label attached to it at the bottom asking you for a key.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:15.48,0:03:18.10,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,这相当于获得可在任意设备使用的免费许可证
Dialogue: 2,0:03:15.48,0:03:18.10,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,You basically got a free license that you can use anywhere.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:18.88,0:03:23.16,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,某种程度上像是作弊码——与OEM系统锁定的预安装密钥不同
Dialogue: 2,0:03:18.88,0:03:23.16,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,It was sort of a cheat code unlike the OEM system locked pre-installation key,
Dialogue: 1,0:03:23.60,0:03:26.22,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,因为该渠道被嵌入设备固件
Dialogue: 2,0:03:23.60,0:03:26.22,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,since that channel is embedded into the device's firmware,
Dialogue: 1,0:03:26.96,0:03:30.36,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,若感兴趣可查阅MSDM ACPI表
Dialogue: 2,0:03:26.96,0:03:30.36,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,specifically the MSDM ACPI table if you're interested,
Dialogue: 1,0:03:30.86,0:03:32.84,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,且无法进行转移
Dialogue: 2,0:03:30.86,0:03:32.84,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,and you can't transfer it anywhere.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:33.40,0:03:39.60,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\fs170}自Windows 10起 OEM授权证书渠道被OEM非系统锁定预安装取代
Dialogue: 2,0:03:33.40,0:03:39.60,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Since Windows 10 the OEM certificate of authority channel was replaced with OEM non-system locked pre-installation,
Dialogue: 1,0:03:40.00,0:03:44.66,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,而OEM系统锁定预安装则改为OEM数字标记
Dialogue: 2,0:03:40.00,0:03:44.66,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,and OEM system locked pre-installation was replaced with OEM digital marker.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:45.12,0:03:50.84,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\fs160}但并非完全取代 因为在Windows Server上仍会遇到系统锁定预安装渠道
Dialogue: 2,0:03:45.12,0:03:50.84,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Not entirely though, because you can still encounter the system locked pre-installation channel on Windows Server.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:51.40,0:03:52.16,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,这套机制相当复杂
Dialogue: 2,0:03:51.40,0:03:52.16,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,It's sophisticated.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:52.90,0:03:57.84,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,无法通过电话激活的渠道可在phoneactivate.exe中找到
Dialogue: 2,0:03:52.90,0:03:57.84,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,But the channels you cannot activate through a phone call can be found inside phoneactivate.exe.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:58.48,0:04:01.80,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,没错 这正是本地system32文件夹里的可执行文件
Dialogue: 2,0:03:58.48,0:04:01.80,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's a real executable in your local system32 folder,
Dialogue: 1,0:04:02.08,0:04:03.68,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,专门负责电话激活功能
Dialogue: 2,0:04:02.08,0:04:03.68,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,responsible for phone activation.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:04.42,0:04:05.62,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,这难道是小岛秀夫设计的吗？
Dialogue: 2,0:04:04.42,0:04:05.62,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Did Kojima write this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.01,0:04:10.01,Enderman-CN-C,,0,0,0,,{\pos(2714.667,1817.333)}*小岛秀夫：游戏制作人、游戏编剧、游戏导演\N代表作：《合金装备》《死亡搁浅》《死亡搁浅2》*
Dialogue: 1,0:04:06.46,0:04:10.18,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,另一种方法是运行slui.exe
Dialogue: 2,0:04:06.46,0:04:10.18,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,There's another option which is to run slui.exe,
Dialogue: 1,0:04:10.34,0:04:11.96,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,即软件许可用户界面
Dialogue: 2,0:04:10.34,0:04:11.96,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,aka software licensing UI,
Dialogue: 1,0:04:12.22,0:04:13.62,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,附带参数4
Dialogue: 2,0:04:12.22,0:04:13.62,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,with a parameter 4.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:14.02,0:04:17.24,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,但最终仍会启动phoneactivate.exe
Dialogue: 2,0:04:14.02,0:04:17.24,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,But it's just going to launch phoneactivate.exe anyway.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:18.16,0:04:21.14,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,以下是通过电话无法激活的渠道类型
Dialogue: 2,0:04:18.16,0:04:21.14,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,These are the channels you cannot activate via phone call.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.99,0:04:32.29,Enderman-CN-C,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\pos(1920,2140)}*仅老版本Windows
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.99,0:04:32.29,Enderman-CN-C,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\pos(1898.666,446.667)}无法通过电话激活的渠道
Dialogue: 1,0:04:33.22,0:04:38.22,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,客户端上的SPP服务本身也可配置为禁用电话激活
Dialogue: 2,0:04:33.22,0:04:38.22,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Now the SPP service itself on the client can be configured to disable phone activation too.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:38.54,0:04:42.32,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,相关配置存储在xrm-ms文件中
Dialogue: 2,0:04:38.54,0:04:42.32,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,The configuration is stored in xrm-ms files,
Dialogue: 1,0:04:42.68,0:04:44.78,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,这些文件位于system32目录下
Dialogue: 2,0:04:42.68,0:04:44.78,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,which are stored under system32,
Dialogue: 1,0:04:47.28,0:04:49.86,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,Windows Vista系统中SPP文件夹命名为licensing
Dialogue: 2,0:04:47.28,0:04:49.86,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,On Windows Vista the SPP folder is called licensing,
Dialogue: 1,0:04:50.30,0:04:52.36,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,但其他设置都相同
Dialogue: 2,0:04:50.30,0:04:52.36,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,but everything else is the same.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:53.04,0:04:56.74,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,PHN文件控制着各渠道的电话激活权限
Dialogue: 2,0:04:53.04,0:04:56.74,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,PHN files control phone activation eligibility per channel.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:57.08,0:04:59.62,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,不过为何如今这个功能如此隐蔽？
Dialogue: 2,0:04:57.08,0:04:59.62,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,But why is that feature so hidden nowadays?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:00.32,0:05:03.98,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,唯一的原因在于：一旦连接网络
Dialogue: 2,0:05:00.32,0:05:03.98,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,The only reason we don't see it anymore is because the moment you connect to the internet,
Dialogue: 1,0:05:04.26,0:05:05.64,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,系统就会自动触发在线激活
Dialogue: 2,0:05:04.26,0:05:05.64,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,online activation is triggered,
Dialogue: 1,0:05:06.18,0:05:09.22,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,之前输入的所有密钥都会被自动激活
Dialogue: 2,0:05:06.18,0:05:09.22,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,and all the keys you put in prior get activated automatically.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:09.48,0:05:11.24,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,实际上在线激活会在以下情况触发：每次登录时
Dialogue: 2,0:05:09.48,0:05:11.24,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Actually, online activation is triggered every logon,
Dialogue: 1,0:05:11.30,0:05:12.30,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,每次成功建立网络连接时
Dialogue: 2,0:05:11.30,0:05:12.30,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,every successful network connection,
Dialogue: 1,0:05:12.38,0:05:13.44,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,以及每1440分钟定期触发
Dialogue: 2,0:05:12.38,0:05:13.44,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,and every 1440 minutes.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:13.78,0:05:19.20,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,截至2025年10月 解决方案是通过防火墙屏蔽以下域名
Dialogue: 2,0:05:13.78,0:05:19.20,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,The solution to that problem is to block the following domains with your firewall as of October 2025.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:19.70,0:05:22.72,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,或者仅在登录联网后使用SLMGR IPK命令安装产品密钥
Dialogue: 2,0:05:19.70,0:05:22.72,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Or to install a product key with SLMGR IPK only after you logon and connect.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:22.78,0:05:27.62,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,道理都懂 我不想因为这些该死的特殊情况把视频做得太长
Dialogue: 2,0:05:22.78,0:05:27.62,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,You get the point, I don't wanna make a video too long just because of all these f***ing edge cases.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:27.88,0:05:29.40,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,总之未来情况可能变化
Dialogue: 2,0:05:27.88,0:05:29.40,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Anyway, this might change in the future,
Dialogue: 1,0:05:29.60,0:05:36.10,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,所以最稳妥的方案是在激活前彻底禁止Windows连接网络
Dialogue: 2,0:05:29.60,0:05:36.10,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,so the ultimate bulletproof solution is to disallow Windows from connecting to the internet at all prior to activation.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:36.68,0:05:39.50,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,当然也不要使用预激活版本
Dialogue: 2,0:05:36.68,0:05:39.50,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,And obviously, don't use a pre-activated version for this purpose,
Dialogue: 1,0:05:39.90,0:05:41.16,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,这应该不言自明
Dialogue: 2,0:05:39.90,0:05:41.16,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,but this should go without saying.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:41.82,0:05:44.42,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,综上所述 要确保启用电话激活
Dialogue: 2,0:05:41.82,0:05:44.42,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,All in all, to enable phone activation for sure,
Dialogue: 1,0:05:44.84,0:05:50.04,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,你需要：第一 获取支持电话激活的有效渠道密钥
Dialogue: 2,0:05:44.84,0:05:50.04,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,you should, first, acquire a valid key with a channel that can be activated via a phone call,
Dialogue: 1,0:05:50.54,0:05:53.38,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,第二 在初始安装阶段就输入密钥
Dialogue: 2,0:05:50.54,0:05:53.38,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,second, input the key during setup at the beginning,
Dialogue: 1,0:05:54.02,0:05:59.88,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,第三 禁用目标设备网卡或使用全局防火墙屏蔽我提供的域名
Dialogue: 2,0:05:54.02,0:05:59.88,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,third, either disable the target's network card or use a network-wide firewall to block the domains I provided,
Dialogue: 1,0:06:00.32,0:06:02.54,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,最后 正常安装系统
Dialogue: 2,0:06:00.32,0:06:02.54,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,and finally, install the system regularly.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:03.40,0:06:06.02,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,由于bypass NRO现已失效
Dialogue: 2,0:06:03.40,0:06:06.02,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,You'd need to set bypass NRO within Windows Registry,
Dialogue: 1,0:06:06.14,0:06:07.50,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,还需在注册表中设置bypass NRO
Dialogue: 2,0:06:06.14,0:06:07.50,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,since the script is gone now.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:07.64,0:06:08.68,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,微软真是可恶！
Dialogue: 2,0:06:07.64,0:06:08.68,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Damn you Microsoft!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:09.24,0:06:11.54,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,若能满足以上要求
Dialogue: 2,0:06:09.24,0:06:11.54,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,If you manage to satisfy these requirements,
Dialogue: 1,0:06:11.82,0:06:13.74,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,就应该能使用电话激活功能
Dialogue: 2,0:06:11.82,0:06:13.74,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,you should be eligible for phone activation.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:14.42,0:06:15.64,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,闲话少叙
Dialogue: 2,0:06:14.42,0:06:15.64,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,So without further ado,
Dialogue: 1,0:06:15.90,0:06:18.04,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,接下来演示2025年的具体操作
Dialogue: 2,0:06:15.90,0:06:18.04,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,let me show you how this is done in 2025.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:19.06,0:06:22.16,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,既然各位知道我在俄罗斯且是个完美主义者
Dialogue: 2,0:06:19.06,0:06:22.16,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,And since you guys know I live in Russia and I'm a perfectionist,
Dialogue: 1,0:06:22.46,0:06:26.10,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,我会特意付费拨打美国热线 让大家看得过瘾
Dialogue: 2,0:06:22.46,0:06:26.10,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,I'll pay extra to call the US hotline specifically for your viewing pleasure.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:26.96,0:06:28.94,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,本次演示将使用平板电脑进行操作 
Dialogue: 2,0:06:26.96,0:06:28.94,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,I'll be using a tablet for this video,
Dialogue: 1,0:06:29.06,0:06:31.36,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,现在这部手机正用于通话和录制 
Dialogue: 2,0:06:29.06,0:06:31.36,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,since the phone is occupied and recording right now.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:32.24,0:06:34.52,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,我猜你们会问：
Dialogue: 2,0:06:32.24,0:06:34.52,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,The reasonable question I'm expecting is,
Dialogue: 1,0:06:34.68,0:06:36.82,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,Anderman 何必费心搞电话激活？
Dialogue: 2,0:06:34.68,0:06:36.82,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Anderman, why even bother with phone activation?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:37.38,0:06:39.34,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,确实存在实际应用场景 
Dialogue: 2,0:06:37.38,0:06:39.34,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,And there is a practical use case.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:40.04,0:06:43.04,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,除通用密钥外 所有序列号均有激活次数限制 
Dialogue: 2,0:06:40.04,0:06:43.04,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Every key except generics has a limited amount of uses,
Dialogue: 1,0:06:43.28,0:06:45.42,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,在微软后台有严格的使用次数限制
Dialogue: 2,0:06:43.28,0:06:45.42,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,strictly specified on the Microsoft backend.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:46.22,0:06:47.96,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,每当使用密钥激活时
Dialogue: 2,0:06:46.22,0:06:47.96,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Whenever a key is used for activation,
Dialogue: 1,0:06:48.18,0:06:50.86,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,使用次数就会在后台服务器上增加并保存
Dialogue: 2,0:06:48.18,0:06:50.86,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,the amount is incremented and saved on the backend server.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:51.56,0:06:52.82,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,如果密钥使用次数耗尽
Dialogue: 2,0:06:51.56,0:06:52.82,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,And if you use up the key,
Dialogue: 1,0:06:52.96,0:06:56.58,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,比如10次 激活服务器就会拒绝该密钥
Dialogue: 2,0:06:52.96,0:06:56.58,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,let's say, 10 times, the activation server will reject it,
Dialogue: 1,0:06:56.82,0:06:58.70,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,在线激活就会失败 
Dialogue: 2,0:06:56.82,0:06:58.70,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,and the online activation will fail.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:59.46,0:07:03.02,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,但电话激活的使用次数上限更高
Dialogue: 2,0:06:59.46,0:07:03.02,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,However, phone activation has a higher threshold of uses,
Dialogue: 1,0:07:03.70,0:07:12.61,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\fs130}假设上限是15次 那么每个被后端服务器拒绝的有效密钥都可以通过电话额外激活几次
Dialogue: 2,0:07:03.70,0:07:12.61,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,assume it's 15, so every valid key that gets rejected by the backend server could be redeemed with a phone call an extra couple times.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:12.92,0:07:16.12,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,不过电话激活的额外次数也是有限制的 
Dialogue: 2,0:07:12.92,0:07:16.12,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,There's a limit though as to how many redemption shots you get.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:16.80,0:07:19.16,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,具体能额外激活多少次也相当不明确 
Dialogue: 2,0:07:16.80,0:07:19.16,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,It's also quite unclear as to how many there are,
Dialogue: 1,0:07:19.44,0:07:24.36,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\fs150}但平均来说 每个密钥通常能进行5到10次在线激活 以及5次电话补救激活 
Dialogue: 2,0:07:19.44,0:07:24.36,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,but let's say on average you get 5 to 10 online shots and 5 redemption shots per key.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:24.98,0:07:26.16,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,当这些次数用尽后
Dialogue: 2,0:07:24.98,0:07:26.16,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,After these are exhausted,
Dialogue: 1,0:07:26.52,0:07:27.94,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,该密钥将被永久封禁 
Dialogue: 2,0:07:26.52,0:07:27.94,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,the key is banned for good.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:28.18,0:07:31.00,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,所以如果你有个被微软拒绝的备用密钥
Dialogue: 2,0:07:28.18,0:07:31.00,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,So if you've got a spare key that gets rejected by Microsoft,
Dialogue: 1,0:07:31.24,0:07:32.38,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,不妨试试这个方法
Dialogue: 2,0:07:31.24,0:07:32.38,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,you can give this a whirl.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:54.19,0:07:57.21,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,如你所见 美国热线行不通
Dialogue: 2,0:07:54.19,0:07:57.21,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,As you can see, the US hotline did not work.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:57.65,0:08:00.75,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,这会不会是因为我用俄罗斯号码拨打呢？
Dialogue: 2,0:07:57.65,0:08:00.75,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Could this possibly be because I'm dialing from a Russian number?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:02.35,0:08:06.53,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,您拨打的号码是空号
Dialogue: 2,0:08:02.35,0:08:06.53,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,The number you have dialed is not in use.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:07.79,0:08:10.23,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,澳大利亚的两条热线也都失败了
Dialogue: 2,0:08:07.79,0:08:10.23,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Both Australian hotlines failed me too.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:10.87,0:08:12.95,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,于是我接着拨打了英国热线
Dialogue: 2,0:08:10.87,0:08:12.95,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,So the next one I called was British.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:24.80,0:08:25.34,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,有希望吗
Dialogue: 2,0:08:24.80,0:08:25.34,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Promising?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:30.46,0:08:33.18,Enderman-CN-C,,0,0,0,,{\fs170\i1\pos(1928,1988)}正在接通微软产品激活服务中心
Dialogue: 1,0:08:33.30,0:08:33.90,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,天啊
Dialogue: 2,0:08:33.30,0:08:33.90,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Oh my god.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:33.94,0:08:35.56,Enderman-CN-C,,0,0,0,,{\fs170\i1\pos(1928,1988)}为帮助我们改进产品
Dialogue: 1,0:08:35.80,0:08:36.92,Enderman-CN-C,,0,0,0,,{\fs170\i1\pos(1928,1988)}服务和培训质量
Dialogue: 1,0:08:37.18,0:08:38.62,Enderman-CN-C,,0,0,0,,{\fs170\i1\pos(1928,1988)}本次通话可能被录音或监听
Dialogue: 1,0:08:38.96,0:08:42.08,Enderman-CN-C,,0,0,0,,{\fs170\i1\pos(1928,1988)}微软全球分支机构 子公司及服务提供商
Dialogue: 1,0:08:42.08,0:08:44.74,Enderman-CN-C,,0,0,0,,{\fs170\i1\pos(1928,1988)}均可获取通话收集的信息
Dialogue: 1,0:08:45.02,0:08:47.58,Enderman-CN-C,,0,0,0,,{\fs170\i1\pos(1928,1988)}若同意本次通话被录音或监听
Dialogue: 1,0:08:47.98,0:08:48.58,Enderman-CN-C,,0,0,0,,{\fs170\i1\pos(1928,1988)}请按1
Dialogue: 1,0:08:49.50,0:08:50.96,Enderman-CN-C,,0,0,0,,{\fs170\i1\pos(1928,1988)}若要在无录音状态下继续...
Dialogue: 1,0:08:53.30,0:08:55.62,Enderman-CN-C,,0,0,0,,{\fs170\i1\pos(1928,1988)}未检测到有效响应
Dialogue: 1,0:08:56.66,0:08:57.56,Enderman-CN-C,,0,0,0,,{\fs170\i1\pos(1928,1988)}请重试 
Dialogue: 1,0:08:57.62,0:08:58.30,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,哦 是不是应该按2？
Dialogue: 2,0:08:57.62,0:08:58.30,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Oh, is it actually 2?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:03.04,0:09:05.32,Enderman-CN-C,,0,0,0,,{\fs170\i1\pos(1928,1988)}本次通话将不会被录音或监听 
Dialogue: 1,0:09:05.70,0:09:06.82,Enderman-CN-C,,0,0,0,,{\fs170\i1\pos(1928,1988)}出于安全考虑 
Dialogue: 1,0:09:07.28,0:09:09.34,Enderman-CN-C,,0,0,0,,{\fs170\i1\pos(1928,1988)}请您重复以下数字：
Dialogue: 1,0:09:14.44,0:09:17.26,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,好的 让我快进到第一次通话的结尾 
Dialogue: 2,0:09:14.44,0:09:17.26,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Okay, let me fast forward to the end of my first call.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:20.78,0:09:22.56,Enderman-CN-C,,0,0,0,,{\fs170\i1\pos(1928,1988)}这样对吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:09:22.88,0:09:23.24,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,是的 
Dialogue: 2,0:09:22.88,0:09:23.24,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:28.53,0:09:29.23,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,哎呀 
Dialogue: 2,0:09:28.53,0:09:29.23,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Whoops.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:33.44,0:09:35.18,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,是我的余额用完了吗？
Dialogue: 2,0:09:33.44,0:09:35.18,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Did I run out of balance?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:36.90,0:09:37.60,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,可能吧？
Dialogue: 2,0:09:36.90,0:09:37.60,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Possibly?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:38.38,0:09:40.44,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,没错 就是这样 
Dialogue: 2,0:09:38.38,0:09:40.44,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,No, that's what happened.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:41.08,0:09:41.54,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,糟糕 
Dialogue: 2,0:09:41.08,0:09:41.54,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Crap.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:42.40,0:09:43.48,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,我们重新试试 
Dialogue: 2,0:09:42.40,0:09:43.48,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Let's retry that.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:47.18,0:09:51.66,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,我发现国际通话会快速消耗余额 
Dialogue: 2,0:09:47.18,0:09:51.66,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,I can see the international calls burn through the balance really fast,
Dialogue: 1,0:09:51.80,0:09:56.02,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,所以刚才没来得及在电话里报完我的安装ID 
Dialogue: 2,0:09:51.80,0:09:56.02,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,so I didn't have enough time to go through my installation ID on the phone.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:57.74,0:10:00.76,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,现在我充了一笔钱 
Dialogue: 2,0:09:57.74,0:10:00.76,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Okay, so I deposited a bunch of money,
Dialogue: 1,0:10:01.20,0:10:03.48,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,应该没问题了 
Dialogue: 2,0:10:01.20,0:10:03.48,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,and I think we're good to go now.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:05.94,0:10:07.46,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,让我们速战速决吧 
Dialogue: 2,0:10:05.94,0:10:07.46,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Let's get this over with.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:12.63,0:10:13.27,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,好的 
Dialogue: 2,0:10:12.63,0:10:13.27,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Alright.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:20.31,0:10:23.33,Enderman-CN-C,,0,0,0,,{\fs170\i1\pos(1928,1988)}开始录制微软产品激活调查 
Dialogue: 2,0:10:20.31,0:10:23.33,Enderman-CN-C,,0,0,0,,{\fs170\i1\pos(1930.667,2121.333)}Recording the Microsoft product activation surveys.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:31.22,0:10:31.90,Enderman-CN-C,,0,0,0,,{\fs170\i1\pos(1928,1988)}谢谢 
Dialogue: 1,0:10:32.56,0:10:36.14,Enderman-CN-C,,0,0,0,,{\fs170\i1\pos(1928,1988)}若需最快捷的产品激活方式 
Dialogue: 1,0:10:36.58,0:10:39.38,Enderman-CN-C,,0,0,0,,{\fs170\i1\pos(1928,1988)}我可为您转接在线激活服务 
Dialogue: 1,0:10:39.78,0:10:43.18,Enderman-CN-C,,0,0,0,,{\fs170\i1\pos(1928,1988)}只需几次点击即可完成激活流程 
Dialogue: 1,0:10:43.88,0:10:46.46,Enderman-CN-C,,0,0,0,,{\fs170\i1\pos(1928,1988)}如果您来电是为了激活Mac版Office 
Dialogue: 1,0:10:46.72,0:10:49.84,Enderman-CN-C,,0,0,0,,{\fs170\i1\pos(1928,1988)}或者如果您无法使用联网设备
Dialogue: 1,0:10:50.14,0:10:51.22,Enderman-CN-C,,0,0,0,,{\fs170\i1\pos(1928,1988)}请保持通话 
Dialogue: 1,0:10:52.22,0:10:56.80,Enderman-CN-C,,0,0,0,,{\fs170\i1\pos(1928,1988)}是否需要我为您提供在线激活服务的网址？
Dialogue: 1,0:10:57.62,0:10:58.30,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 2,0:10:57.62,0:10:58.30,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:02.10,0:11:03.10,Enderman-CN-C,,0,0,0,,{\fs170\i1\pos(1928,1988)}好的 没问题 
Dialogue: 1,0:11:03.88,0:11:05.62,Enderman-CN-C,,0,0,0,,{\fs170\i1\pos(1928,1988)}我们试试不同的方法 
Dialogue: 1,0:11:06.58,0:11:11.11,Enderman-CN-C,,0,0,0,,{\fs170\i1\pos(1928,1988)}您来电是为了咨询远程桌面授权问题吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:11:11.28,0:11:12.20,Enderman-CN-C,,0,0,0,,{\fs170\i1\pos(1928,1988)}还是其他问题？
Dialogue: 1,0:11:13.04,0:11:15.58,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,我需要通过电话激活Windows 
Dialogue: 2,0:11:13.04,0:11:15.58,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,I need to activate Windows via a phone call.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:19.32,0:11:20.78,Enderman-CN-C,,0,0,0,,{\fs170\i1\pos(1928,1988)}好的 激活协助 
Dialogue: 1,0:11:21.72,0:11:23.88,Enderman-CN-C,,0,0,0,,{\fs170\i1\pos(1928,1988)}在开始激活流程前 
Dialogue: 1,0:11:24.30,0:11:27.02,Enderman-CN-C,,0,0,0,,{\fs170\i1\pos(1928,1988)}请问您是否正在电脑前并打开了激活窗口？
Dialogue: 1,0:11:27.50,0:11:27.98,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,是的 
Dialogue: 2,0:11:27.50,0:11:27.98,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:31.75,0:11:32.63,Enderman-CN-C,,0,0,0,,{\fs170\i1\pos(1928,1988)}好的 感谢配合 
Dialogue: 1,0:11:33.67,0:11:35.37,Enderman-CN-C,,0,0,0,,{\fs170\i1\pos(1928,1988)}为了激活您的产品 
Dialogue: 1,0:11:35.65,0:11:37.77,Enderman-CN-C,,0,0,0,,{\fs170\i1\pos(1928,1988)}我需要确认您的安装ID 
Dialogue: 1,0:11:38.89,0:11:43.49,Enderman-CN-C,,0,0,0,,{\fs170\i1\pos(1928,1988)}这个编号会以6-7位数字分组的形式显示在激活窗口中 
Dialogue: 1,0:11:44.45,0:11:46.23,Enderman-CN-C,,0,0,0,,{\fs170\i1\pos(1928,1988)}屏幕上显示这个号码了吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:11:46.59,0:11:47.03,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 2,0:11:46.59,0:11:47.03,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:51.74,0:11:55.80,Enderman-CN-C,,0,0,0,,{\fs170\i1\pos(1928,1988)}请准备好后告诉我 我将开始记录安装ID 
Dialogue: 1,0:11:56.19,0:11:57.41,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,我准备好了
Dialogue: 2,0:11:56.19,0:11:57.41,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,I'm ready to begin.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:01.25,0:12:04.01,Enderman-CN-C,,0,0,0,,{\fs170\i1\pos(1928,1988)}好的 请大声读出第一组数字
Dialogue: 1,0:12:04.39,0:12:06.03,Enderman-CN-C,,0,0,0,,{\fs170\i1\pos(1928,1988)}请逐位报读数字
Dialogue: 1,0:14:37.67,0:14:39.81,Enderman-CN-C,,0,0,0,,{\fs170\i1\pos(1928,1988)}请继续下一组数字
Dialogue: 1,0:14:41.23,0:14:46.73,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,该系统最初的设计理念可能是为了将违规用户转接至微软客服
Dialogue: 2,0:14:41.23,0:14:46.73,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,The original idea behind this system was probably to connect the cheeky customers with a Microsoft representative,
Dialogue: 1,0:14:47.11,0:14:51.51,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,让他们解释为何重复激活同一密钥超10次
Dialogue: 2,0:14:47.11,0:14:51.51,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,where they would have to explain why they wanted to abuse the same key 10 plus times.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:52.07,0:14:53.07,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,但据我所知
Dialogue: 2,0:14:52.07,0:14:53.07,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,But as far as I know,
Dialogue: 1,0:14:53.21,0:14:56.13,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,该机制从未实际启用 用户始终面对自动应答
Dialogue: 2,0:14:53.21,0:14:56.13,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,this was never implemented and you always got a bot regardless.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:56.13,0:14:58.59,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,或许微软认为无需打击个人盗版
Dialogue: 2,0:14:56.13,0:14:58.59,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,I guess consumer piracy isn't worth fighting.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:59.15,0:15:00.53,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,如今Windows基本免费
Dialogue: 2,0:14:59.15,0:15:00.53,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Windows is basically free now,
Dialogue: 1,0:15:00.69,0:15:02.65,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,激活机制反而成了附加挑战
Dialogue: 2,0:15:00.69,0:15:02.65,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,and the activation is an added challenge.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:02.93,0:15:04.39,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,微软对此并不在意
Dialogue: 2,0:15:02.93,0:15:04.39,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Microsoft don't care.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:06.50,0:16:09.54,Enderman-CN-C,,0,0,0,,{\fs170\i1\pos(1928,1988)}正在验证您的安装ID 请稍候
Dialogue: 1,0:16:10.44,0:16:12.88,Enderman-CN-C,,0,0,0,,{\fs170\i1\pos(1928,1988)}安装ID已通过验证
Dialogue: 1,0:16:13.94,0:16:15.10,Enderman-CN-C,,0,0,0,,{\fs170\i1\pos(1928,1988)}为完成激活
Dialogue: 1,0:16:15.64,0:16:17.66,Enderman-CN-C,,0,0,0,,{\fs170\i1\pos(1928,1988)}现在将向您播报确认ID
Dialogue: 1,0:16:18.38,0:16:22.00,Enderman-CN-C,,0,0,0,,{\fs170\i1\pos(1928,1988)}我将以六位数分段播报确认ID
Dialogue: 1,0:16:22.28,0:16:25.94,Enderman-CN-C,,0,0,0,,{\fs170\i1\pos(1928,1988)}请您将数字填入激活窗口的对应空白区域
Dialogue: 1,0:16:26.82,0:16:30.98,Enderman-CN-C,,0,0,0,,{\fs170\i1\pos(1928,1988)}准备好接收确认ID时请告知
Dialogue: 1,0:16:31.72,0:16:33.18,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,我已准备好开始
Dialogue: 2,0:16:31.72,0:16:33.18,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,I am ready to start.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:03.32,0:17:06.38,Enderman-CN-C,,0,0,0,,{\fs170\i1\pos(1928,1988)}输入完成后请说“下一步”
Dialogue: 1,0:17:07.40,0:17:09.60,Enderman-CN-C,,0,0,0,,{\fs170\i1\pos(1928,1988)}如需重复可随时告知
Dialogue: 1,0:20:23.92,0:20:26.42,Enderman-CN-C,,0,0,0,,{\fs170\i1\pos(1928,1988)}这是最后一个区域
Dialogue: 1,0:20:50.46,0:20:52.28,Enderman-CN-C,,0,0,0,,{\fs170\i1\pos(1928,1988)}完成后请说“完成”
Dialogue: 1,0:20:53.66,0:20:54.52,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,完成 
Dialogue: 2,0:20:53.66,0:20:54.52,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:09.97,0:21:13.49,Enderman-CN-C,,0,0,0,,{\fs170\i1\pos(1928,1988)}需要将其输入激活窗口的H区域
Dialogue: 1,0:21:14.53,0:21:17.47,Enderman-CN-C,,0,0,0,,{\fs170\i1\pos(1928,1988)}准备就绪后请说“下一步”或按1键
Dialogue: 1,0:21:22.59,0:21:24.41,Enderman-CN-C,,0,0,0,,{\fs170\i1\pos(1928,1988)}这就是完整的确认ID
Dialogue: 1,0:21:25.25,0:21:28.15,Enderman-CN-C,,0,0,0,,{\fs170\i1\pos(1928,1988)}现在您屏幕上所有区域应该都已填满
Dialogue: 1,0:21:29.09,0:21:33.67,Enderman-CN-C,,0,0,0,,{\fs170\i1\pos(1928,1988)}在继续之前 请花时间完整抄录这个确认ID
Dialogue: 1,0:21:34.03,0:21:36.87,Enderman-CN-C,,0,0,0,,{\fs170\i1\pos(1928,1988)}日后如需重新激活可重复使用
Dialogue: 1,0:21:42.62,0:21:44.30,Enderman-CN-C,,0,0,0,,{\fs170\i1\pos(1928,1988)}准备就绪后
Dialogue: 1,0:21:44.62,0:21:46.26,Enderman-CN-C,,0,0,0,,{\fs170\i1\pos(1928,1988)}请点击激活按钮
Dialogue: 1,0:21:46.86,0:21:48.68,Enderman-CN-C,,0,0,0,,{\fs170\i1\pos(1928,1988)}若未出现错误提示
Dialogue: 1,0:21:48.86,0:21:51.18,Enderman-CN-C,,0,0,0,,{\fs170\i1\pos(1928,1988)}说明产品已成功激活
Dialogue: 1,0:21:51.98,0:21:54.62,Enderman-CN-C,,0,0,0,,{\fs170\i1\pos(1928,1988)}我将给您一些时间操作 稍后确认
Dialogue: 1,0:22:01.06,0:22:02.08,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,已激活完成
Dialogue: 2,0:22:01.06,0:22:02.08,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,It's activated.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:10.21,0:22:12.21,Enderman-CN-C,,0,0,0,,{\fs170\i1\pos(1928,1988)}若您还需要时间
Dialogue: 1,0:22:12.65,0:22:13.69,Enderman-CN-C,,0,0,0,,{\fs170\i1\pos(1928,1988)}请说“需要更多时间”
Dialogue: 1,0:22:14.63,0:22:18.09,Enderman-CN-C,,0,0,0,,{\fs170\i1\pos(1928,1988)}请问您是否成功完成了激活？
Dialogue: 1,0:22:26.86,0:22:27.86,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,应该完成了
Dialogue: 2,0:22:26.86,0:22:27.86,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,I think that's it.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:28.54,0:22:29.42,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,我们成功了
Dialogue: 2,0:22:28.54,0:22:29.42,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,We've succeeded.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:30.80,0:22:31.32,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 2,0:22:30.80,0:22:31.32,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Excellent.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:36.09,0:22:37.11,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,非常棒
Dialogue: 2,0:22:36.09,0:22:37.11,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Very nice.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:44.28,0:22:45.56,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,至此结束
Dialogue: 2,0:22:44.28,0:22:45.56,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,So, this is it.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:45.82,0:22:47.78,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,希望能从本期视频中学到新知识
Dialogue: 2,0:22:45.82,0:22:47.78,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,I hope you learned something new from this video.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:48.34,0:22:54.84,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,特别感谢Wither or Not多次为我讲解现代Windows激活原理
Dialogue: 2,0:22:48.34,0:22:54.84,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Huge thanks to Wither or Not for giving me multiple lectures on how modern Windows activation works and a big shout out
Dialogue: 1,0:22:54.84,0:23:00.42,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\fs170}同时致敬Mass系统整理了所有Windows激活资料并开拓了新领域
Dialogue: 2,0:22:54.84,0:23:00.42,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,to Mass for systematizing all the information we have about Windows activation and coming up with new stuff.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:00.98,0:23:03.40,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,感谢观看 祝您一切安好
Dialogue: 2,0:23:00.98,0:23:03.40,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Thank you for watching and take care.
